ctly from the assessment, measured by the packaging epic\n  being able to proceed without re-analyzing licenses.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-2 (P0, standard suites available out of the box): this investigation\n  determines how \"out of the box\" can be delivered per suite.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":42166,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8ab59d602e88fa4e","agent_id":"ae71d3c6187365b78","session_id":"b48ac94b-45e8-413d-be21-820bec1a5f5b","uuid":"e98e0321-383f-47a4-8a3f-ae0a0811ea0e","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:55:04.963Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9002"}
