{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-baa0b4c68a424a73","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9002-E008\n3\ttitle: Product documentation for the evaluation workflow\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9002\n5\tcomponent: Documentation\n6\tteam: RHOAI Documentation\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\timplementation_type: docs-authoring\n10\tdependencies:\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9002-E004\n12\t- RHAISTRAT-9002-E005\n13\t- RHAISTRAT-9002-E006\n14\t- RHAISTRAT-9002-E007\n15\tai_signals:\n16\t  change_specificity: 0\n17\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n18\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n19\t  existing_foundation: 1\n20\t  open_questions: 0\n21\t  external_dependency: 0\n22\t  human_process_gates: -1\n23\t  repo_access: 1\n24\t  architecture_claims: 0\n25\tinvestigation_signals: null\n26\tai_implementability: Medium\n27\tai_implementability_score: 2\n28\tjira_key: null\n29\tbranch: null\n30\tgated_by: null\n31\tgate_failure_impact: null\n32\t---\n33\t# Product documentation for the evaluation workflow\n34\t\n35\t## Description\n36\t\n37\tAuthor end-to-end product documentation for the GenAI model evaluation\n38\tcapability: launching evaluations of served models, selecting standard and\n39\tcustom benchmark suites, reading and comparing results, embedding evaluations\n40\tin pipelines, and authoring custom evaluation tasks. Documentation describes\n41\twhat was actually built and runs last in the strategy.\n42\t\n43\t## Scope\n44\t\n45\t- New documentation topics covering the evaluation workflow end to end:\n46\t  launching an evaluation against a served model (KServe endpoint or Llama\n47\t  Stack distribution), out-of-the-box standard suites, interpreting run status\n48\t  and per-benchmark scores, and side-by-side model version comparison in the\n49\t  Dashboard.\n50\t- A custom task authoring guide: defining custom evaluation tasks with\n51\t  user-supplied datasets and metrics and running them through the same flow.\n52\t- Coverage of the pipeline-embedded evaluation step and promotion gating usage\n53\t  (gate, human promotes).\n54\t- Coverage of benchmark suite availability in disconnected environments\n55\t  (bundled vs. customer-fetch) as delivered by the suite packaging work.\n56\t\n57\t## Content Outline\n58\t\n59\t1. Evaluation capability overview and concepts (benchmark suites, results,\n60\t   model version linkage).\n61\t2. Launching an evaluation (served model selection, suite selection, run\n62\t   monitoring).\n63\t3. Reading results and comparing model versions.\n64\t4. Custom evaluation task authoring (datasets, metrics, running through the\n65\t   standard flow).\n66\t5. Evaluations in Data Science Pipelines (promotion gating).\n67\t6. Disconnected-environment suite availability.\n68\t7. Troubleshooting evaluation runs.\n69\t\n70\t## Acceptance Criteria\n71\t\n72\t- **Given** the delivered evaluation capability, **when** a user follows the\n73\t  documentation from zero, **then** they can launch a standard-suite evaluation\n74\t  and read its results, measured by documentation validation against the\n75\t  implemented workflow.\n76\t- The custom task authoring guide walks through defining and running one custom\n77\t  task end to end.\n78\t- All topics are technically reviewed against the implementation by the\n79\t  component teams before publication.\n80\t- Documentation covers the evaluation execution workflow as implemented —\n81\t  including whichever execution approach was selected by the execution-engine\n82\t  decision — verified during technical review.\n83\t\n84\t## HLR Traceability\n85\t\n86\t- HLR-9 (P2): product documentation covers the evaluation workflow end to end,\n87\t  including custom task authoring — full coverage.\n88\t\n89\t## Dependencies (plain terms)\n90\t\n91\tBlocked by all implementation work in the strategy (benchmark suite packaging,\n92\tresult persistence, Dashboard integration, pipeline step, and the execution path\n93\tas delivered), because the documentation describes the built system.\n94\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bee1af9f44323e62","agent_id":"ac6fccb22a2a1fcbe","session_id":"b48ac94b-45e8-413d-be21-820bec1a5f5b","uuid":"283c29e7-d2d7-4c84-abc6-9c43b7e34615","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:20:51.993Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-baa0b4c68a424a73","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9002 decomposition"}
